<title>USA: Devry authorizes two-for-one stock split.</title>
<headline>Devry authorizes two-for-one stock split.</headline>
<dateline>OAKBROOK TERRACE, Ill. 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>DeVry Inc said Tuesday its board of directors authorized a two-for-one stock split in the form of a 100 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The dividend will be payable on December 18 to shareholders of record on December 2.</p>
<p>DeVry owns and operates higher-education systems in North America.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
